6240932_1006833619046280_2584089611186508700_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7aKY2eJC290Q7kNvwEAA7xj&_nc_oc=Adq8BKvFqMn4DaLbCHIfl1pg4MYKFl7Xx8tESLhcosZC2q3zIkz-YVeZfAgfC_qJpN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG8PmIKlAJVZkuZBlTUxScWMzd-1fpM9phLyLpCQkobeQ&oe=6A902600"}, {"file_name": "com.leafandlight.carcrasharena-20260810-081754-2560x1440.png", "id": "1369825404525766", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_1369825407859099_4984911118875579209_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MI3fiQke32oQ7kNvwHQYnBf&_nc_oc=Adq5AQcO1UIm8USF3EjxjtGGnk_0mo3tiAeZD9dzk736oBRCbekeb7Y4vKJL19MEsl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExZMXj71Xz3o95fRp50Terjo6MBCXCLGmyohrKfOyFBg&oe=6A9030AC"}, {"file_name": "com.leafandlight.carcrasharena-20260810-081730-2560x1440.png", "id": "2213113889537634", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_2213113892870967_7759255486201490021_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sj37ZAzhebwQ7kNvwHGrWgW&_nc_oc=AdrzFIqwF5ZyUWxPr2eo-po8Ar8bM9j-mwYNEVhRXDt_GP2WYx_iXvjKL44aT_eUcjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFkXSK4s7KhzmWwbIspiLyxnPAB15uZeZEBbsovoQ7kZw&oe=6A9035CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_044_0009.png", "id": "1303495935267871", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1303495938601204_6101607894595342530_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2NTUCniP6gwQ7kNvwH_3ytI&_nc_oc=AdonawuWB0YljriZHpKnbi4swL3eVp1thzhkDxsPY8cTi09IUH86T2H3TNLi_uFglxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHG2Hu_X9pXK2hdQ_pGNYtKxDqSpHCgcKONA8wRNNI8CQ&oe=6A9036F6"}, "display_name": "Car Crash Arena", "keywords": ["combat", "car", "battle", "destruction", "crash"], "long_description": "THIS IS NOT A RACE. YOUR CAR IS A WEAPON.\n\nCar Crash Arena is a single-player cockpit VR vehicle-combat game where demolition derby crashes, weapons, zombies, upgrades, and physics-driven hazards collide in a post-apocalyptic arena. Choose your car, enter the tournament, survive escalating waves, and turn every impact into points.\n\n{1323862079544884}\n\nRAM, SHOOT, SURVIVE\n\nHit the nitro, slam rival cars from the side, crush zombies, fire cockpit weapons, launch enemies into traps, escape the crane, dodge bombs, and avoid acid pits and moving machinery. Rival vehicles attack you and each other, recover from crashes, and return for another hit.\n{1594360845441526}\nBUILD A COMBAT CAR\n\nUnlock vehicles and equip spikes, guns, flares, damage boosts, and other upgrades. Build for raw damage, control, or survival.\n{28962886803299796}\nCHASE THE HIGH SCORE\n\nFight through short, replayable runs, improve your records, and compete on global and Friends leaderboards.\n{1998673274183767}\nFEATURES\n\n\u2022 First-person VR cockpit driving\n\u2022 Demolition derby and arcade vehicle combat\n\u2022 Enemy cars, zombies, weapons, nitro, and upgrades\n\u2022 Cranes, bombs, traps, acid, and moving hazards\n\u2022 Physics-driven crashes, flips, explosions, and destruction\n\u2022 Global and Friends leaderboards\n\u2022 Seated or standing play\n{1556336889137256}\nCar Crash Arena is in Early Access and is actively improving through player feedback, with ongoing work on damage feedback, steering, effects, balance, and new content.\n{1640774564265454}\nDrive hard. Hit harder. Survive the arena.\n{1514434543770239}\n{1084955644221076}\n{907329338589421}\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Enter the ultimate VR car combat tournament. Customize your ride, unlock powerful skills, and equip devastating upgrades such as spikes, guns, flares, damage boosts, and more to dominate the arena."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/car-crash-arena-site/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_nam